docs {
  # AcademicService.ListPeriods

  Periods with their terms

  `/ltedu.academic.v1.AcademicService/ListPeriods` · unary · `ltedu/academic/v1/academic.proto`

  ## Request — `ListPeriodsRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `ListPeriodsResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `context` | `AcademicContext` |  |
  | `periods` | `repeated Period` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `AcademicContext`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
